 <COL N="0501B"></COL> vicem Joannis <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0501" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0501D"></COL> Ae., T. 2,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Argibadonii episcopi Eliberitani.</HI></NOTE>  Egarensis episcopi.</ITEM> <ITEM>Sisuldus abbas agens vicem Stephani Carcassensis
