laetabor super eloquia tua, V, 151.—164. Septies in die
laudem dixi tibi, V, 229.</ITEM> <ITEM><HI REND="ITALIC">Ps.</HI>  CXX—4. Non dormitabit, neque dormiet, qui custodit
Israel, VI, 87.</ITEM> <ITEM><HI REND="ITALIC">Ps.</HI>  CXXV.—2  <HI REND="ITALIC">et</HI>  3. Tunc dicent inter gentes, magnificavit
