nobiscum, facti sumus laetantes, VI, 83  <HI REND="ITALIC">et</HI>  102.</ITEM> <ITEM><HI REND="ITALIC">Ps.</HI>  CXXVI.—2. Surgite, postquam sederitis, V, 331.—4.
